[http://betterthanyours.com/ betterthanyours.com]

Basic Webhosting Pack 'H5' 

5 MB Disk Space, 500 MB Traffic ea. Month, 5 POP E-mail Accounts <nowiki>w/Web</nowiki> Access, 1 Mailing List & Mailing List Manager, Unlimited E-mail Aliases, Unlimited E-mail Forwarding, 1 Catchall E-mail, 1 FTP Account, Web-Based Control Panel, Spam Control, Frontpage Extensions, PHP, Password-Protected Directories, Shopping Carts, Server Side Includes (SSI), cgi-bin with PERL, Log Files & Site Stats, Daily Backup, 24x7 Server Monitoring & Tech Support by e-mail, and many more options available; price is per year 
$ 14.95 

Basic Webhosting Pack 'H10' 

Everything included in Webhosting Pack 'H5', but double the Disk Space at 10 MB, double the Traffic ea. Month at 1000 MB, double the POP E-mail Accounts (10), double the Mailing Lists (2), double the FTP Accounts (2), and many more options available; price is per year 
$ 28.95 

Comprehensive Webhosting Pack 'H20' 

Everything included in Webhosting Pack 'H5', but four times the Disk Space at 20 MB, four times the Traffic ea. Month at 2000 MB, four times the POP E-mail Accounts (20), four times the Mailing Lists (4), four times the FTP Accounts (4), and many more options available; price is per year 
$ 56.95 

Advanced Webhosting Pack 'H40' 

Everything including in Webhosting Pack 'H5', but eight times the Disk Space at 40 MB, eight times the Traffic ea. Month at 4000 MB, eight times the POP E-mail Accounts (40), eight times the Mailing Lists (8), eight times the FTP Accounts (8), and many more options available; price is per year 
$ 112.95 

No Domain Name Service. Suggest use <nowiki>GoDaddy</nowiki>.com for domain names, at approx. $8.95 for the domain name.

